352
00:22:01.237 --> 00:22:03.865
Been servin' up so many niggas...

353
00:22:03.990 --> 00:22:05.742
my arms is tired. Like...

354
00:22:05.867 --> 00:22:07.702
Shit. My dick about to be tired

355
00:22:07.827 --> 00:22:10.038
from all these bitches out here
I'ma smash 'cause...

356
00:22:16.419 --> 00:22:18.546
- Please. Please. man.
- No.

357
00:22:26.512 --> 00:22:27.972
Fuck am I even doing?

358
00:22:56.292 --> 00:22:58.753
Donaldson got
so drunk on a Friday night.

359
