427
00:27:34.111 --> 00:27:36.280
But I'm all fucked up out here. Lou-Lou.

428
00:27:40.701 --> 00:27:42.328
Don't even know what I'm doin'.

429
00:27:44.372 --> 00:27:45.956
Never been like this before.

430
00:27:46.832 --> 00:27:48.584
Don't have no feel for the game.

431
00:27:51.879 --> 00:27:53.756
I keep askin' myself questions...

432
00:27:55.591 --> 00:27:56.967
but I ain't got no answers.

433
00:27:59.595 --> 00:28:01.305
