434
00:28:03.265 --> 00:28:04.350
Thing is...

435
00:28:04.975 --> 00:28:06.477
I don't know what that look like.

436
00:28:07.186 --> 00:28:08.479
But I gotta do somethin'.

437
00:28:10.398 --> 00:28:11.857
I gotta feel somethin'.

438
00:28:14.443 --> 00:28:15.653
Fuck.

439
00:28:17.113 --> 00:28:18.572
I miss you. Lou.

440
00:28:32.628 --> 00:28:33.712
Appreciate you seein' me.

441
00:28:34.338 --> 00:28:35.965
