Lou to have said about you?

467
00:29:39.278 --> 00:29:40.321
I don't know.

468
00:29:42.448 --> 00:29:43.908
Just tryin' to remember him.

469
00:29:45.159 --> 00:29:46.243
That's all.

470
00:29:46.869 --> 00:29:48.349
