477
00:30:05.721 --> 00:30:07.598
it is about you. Ms. Thomas.

478
00:30:08.933 --> 00:30:10.601
It's always about you.

479
00:30:28.869 --> 00:30:29.869
Garcia!

480
00:30:30.663 --> 00:30:33.582
You fucked up my party
last night. you motherfucker.

481
00:30:35.334 --> 00:30:37.253
Now I'ma fuck up yours.

482
00:30:40.464 --> 00:30:43.008
I'm just sayin'. shit's ill. That's all.

483
00:30:44.260 --> 00:30:45.719
Can't get caught slippin'.

484
00:30:48.973 --> 00:30:50.724
Fuck y'all doin' here?

485
00:30:52.142 --> 00:30:54.895
Y'all need to be out there
servin' up this work.

486
00:30:55.854 --> 00:30:58.315
Niggas shook about
what happened at the crib.

487
00:30:58.482 --> 00:31:00.901
Saw they life flash
in front of 'em and shit.

488
