491
00:31:12.705 --> 00:31:14.957
Sometime a nigga gotta take a minute.

492
00:31:16.542 --> 00:31:18.377
Fuck you just say to me?

493
00:31:18.502 --> 00:31:20.045
I- I-I'm just sayin'.

494
00:31:20.379 --> 00:31:24.216
sometime... you gotta take a step back

495
00:31:24.383 --> 00:31:25.843
and reassess.

496
00:31:26.218 --> 00:31:27.636
Get your life in order.

497
00:31:27.803 --> 00:31:29.513
Shit's scary out here.

498
00:31:29.638 --> 00:31:30.638
Whoa.

499
00:31:30.764 --> 00:31:31.765
- Damn!
- Fuck!

500
00:31:31.932 --> 00:31:33.475
- Whoa!
- What the hell?!

501
00:31:33.642 --> 00:31:34.852
Man. what the fuck?

502
00:31:34.977 --> 00:31:37.187
Anybody else scared?

503
00:31:39.440 --> 00:31:42.443
'Cause I can't have
no scared niggas around me.

504
00:31:43.319 --> 00:31:46.697
You scared. we gon' get you unscared.

505
00:31:46.864 --> 00:31:48.991
You shook. we gon' get you unshook.

506
00:31:50.576 --> 00:31:52.202
Get the fuck back to work!

507
00:31:52.328 --> 00:31:53.454
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

508
00:32:00.961 --> 00:32:03.380
You know how this shit works. Garcia.

509
00:32:04.381 --> 00:32:06.634
You only as good as your clearance rate.

510
00:32:07.843 --> 00:32:10.471
But shoe leather doesn't always
get the job done.

511
00:32:10.638 --> 00:32:12.389
Sometimes we have to wade

512
00:32:12.556 --> 00:32:15.559
