515
00:32:27.905 --> 00:32:30.324
Who were you talkin' to
about Shawn Figueroa?

516
00:32:31.742 --> 00:32:34.787
There's a quid pro quo to this work.

517
00:32:35.746 --> 00:32:38.165
To get information.
you have to give information.

518
00:32:38.582 --> 00:32:40.376
